WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.990
You do not have to search through loose notes before a follow-up.

2
00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:08.030
Open Clients and search for the client's name.

3
00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:11.389
Select the client to open their individual record.

4
00:00:11.389 --> 00:00:14.669
Your records belong to your account.

5
00:00:15.719 --> 00:00:18.519
Choose Sessions to see their approved notes.

6
00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:22.839
Find the consultation date you need, then open the session.

7
00:00:22.839 --> 00:00:28.518
The note stays connected to its original transcript, so you can check what was actually recorded.

8
00:00:31.719 --> 00:00:35.799
Move between Notes, Transcript, and Session Information.

9
00:00:35.799 --> 00:00:39.719
You can also explore the other session tabs.

10
00:00:39.719 --> 00:00:44.198
Treatment Plan includes recorded next steps and separately reviewed plans.

11
00:00:44.198 --> 00:00:47.878
Return to Clients whenever you need another session.

12
00:00:47.878 --> 00:00:51.718
If nothing is listed yet, approve and save a note first.
